# Allowlist: git ignores EVERYTHING in this folder except the files listed below.
# A stray file (CV draft, original photo, notes) can't be committed by accident.
# To publish a new file, add a "!filename" line for it here on purpose.

*

!.gitignore
!index.html
!style.css
!photo.jpg
!favicon.svg
!script.js
!translations.js
!lantern.svg
!jumpscare.jpg
